                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I didn't think splitscreen stealth was possible, But in BADBLOOD it just plain works. You can screen cheat, sometimes you are encouraged to, but be warned: That might be exactly what your opponent wants you to do. It's a very nuanced game that seems simple on the surface but hides a ton of strategy up it's sleeves. \n\nPolished versus gameplay with an incredible art style and good music. If you like local versus multiplayer and want a spin on the classic 1v1 \"deathmatch\" get BADBLOOD.",
